{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きょうは雨が降って\n気温が下がってとても寒い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気温の変化に対応できなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪っぴきになりそうだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/03/31/7023726/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/03/31/7023726/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/03/31/7023726/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと皆さんに話したかった\n嬉しいこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月23日（木）に発売された\n「Zipper」2017年SPRING号の\n表紙を生駒さんと飛鳥と未央奈とやらせてもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年明けにこの話を聞いたので\nすごくうれしかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方の手に取ってもらえたら\n嬉しいなっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/03/31/7023726/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表紙です！\nヤンキー風ファッション！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段の私服とのギャップが嬉しくて\nZipperの撮影は毎回たのしいの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表紙だけではなくく、\n別冊付録「乃木坂46の\"カワイイのヒミツ\"BOOK」にも載せてもらっています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3期生も載ってるから要チェック！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連載のひなコレもみてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなコレのオフショットは1枚目に載せたものです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/03/31/7023726/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親子丼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね、映画の「SING」を見に行ったんだけどすごく面白かったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん笑って\n涙がでたところもあって\n夢を持った者の輝きを久しぶりにみて\n素敵だなって思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子もSINGのこと書きたかったから\n書いたんだけど\nもーこも書いてて嬉しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もーこのブログで度々出てくるチップに\nはやく会ってもらわなきゃ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もーこ、おうちおいでー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/03/31/7023726/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたから4月ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪も寒い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミュージックステーション"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"坂道AKBで出させてもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のグループと一緒に活動することは\n滅多にないことで\nいや、今までの活動になかったので\nそれが新鮮で刺激的でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/03/31/7023726/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/03/31/7023726/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エレベーターに乗ってたら\n途中でしんちゃんが乗ってきたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シロと仲良しのしんちゃんが\n羨ましい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし、映画見にいくぞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/03/31/7023726/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また更新します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ！"}],"source":"archive"}